# -------------------------------------------------------------- sqlite
# `*.db` alone is not enough: a write-ahead log holds pages not yet
# checkpointed into the database, so it carries exactly the same taxpayer
# data. Both sidecars were being staged for commit while the database itself
# was correctly ignored.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
_verify.db
_autogen.db

